    <!-- https://w3id.org/CBGP-App#forms -->

    <owl:Class rdf:about="https://w3id.org/CBGP-App#forms">
        <rdfs:comment xml:lang="es">Los registros administrativos del instituto CBGP (Centro de Biotecnología y Genómica de Plantas, UPM-INIA/CSIC): sus miembros (empleados, investigadores, estudiantes y visitantes), los proyectos de investigación y su financiación, los compromisos de financiación (qué parte del coste salarial de cada persona paga cada proyecto) y las publicaciones.</rdfs:comment>
        <rdfs:comment xml:lang="en">The administrative records of the CBGP institute (Centre for Plant Biotechnology and Genomics, UPM-INIA/CSIC): its members (employees, researchers, students and visitors), research projects and their funding, funding commitments (which share of a person&apos;s salary each project pays) and publications.</rdfs:comment>
        <rdfs:label xml:lang="es">Entrada de datos</rdfs:label>
        <rdfs:label xml:lang="en">Forms</rdfs:label>
    </owl:Class>
    


    <!-- https://w3id.org/CBGP-App#formula-definition -->

    <owl:Class rdf:about="https://w3id.org/CBGP-App#formula-definition">
        <rdfs:comment xml:lang="en">A calculation a form assigns to one of its fields via local:has-formulas, using local:formula-for-field (the question class the result is stored on) and local:formula-expression (a Dentaku expression referencing sibling questionclasses as bare variable names, e.g. &quot;project_total_funding * 0.13&quot;). Each instance belongs to exactly one form, so the same shared question class can be calculated differently per form. The value written to the calculated field is always the server-recomputed result, never anything the user could type or tamper with in the browser.</rdfs:comment>
        <rdfs:label xml:lang="es">Definición de fórmula</rdfs:label>
        <rdfs:label xml:lang="en">Formula definition</rdfs:label>
    </owl:Class>
    


